## Safety measures (minimum three)

- Simulated GUI e-stop and physical e-stop (reset, then separate resume)
- Light curtain / unsafe-zone signal that pauses or slows motion
- Collision prediction with stop or re-plan
- Keep-out zones and safe-speed limits near the working robot

## Planned techniques

- Inverse kinematics and joint-space trajectories for pick and handover
- RMRC for the straight cutting stroke
- Collision checking against objects placed in the planned path

